{"id":"wb-4-195","name":"天护陀罗尼经幢","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"天护陀罗尼经幢","text":"天护陀罗尼经幢位于中国河北省石家庄市井陉矿区横涧乡天户社区（原为天户村），是一座唐朝的佛教经幢，也是中国现存较早的经幢实物。该经幢初为河北省文物保护单位，1996年被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E6%8A%A4%E9%99%80%E7%BD%97%E5%B0%BC%E7%BB%8F%E5%B9%A2","revisionId":92713640,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92713640","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9eb09b1294cef31bc21b23b7.jpg","title":"天户（护）陀罗尼经幢.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A9%E6%88%B7%EF%BC%88%E6%8A%A4%EF%BC%89%E9%99%80%E7%BD%97%E5%B0%BC%E7%BB%8F%E5%B9%A2.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/%E5%A4%A9%E6%88%B7%EF%BC%88%E6%8A%A4%EF%BC%89%E9%99%80%E7%BD%97%E5%B0%BC%E7%BB%8F%E5%B9%A2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"井陉矿区","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","caption":"​天护陀罗尼经幢","width":320,"height":451}}